            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        2 Abam 18:13—19:37; Yes 36:1—37:38.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma y’ivyo vyose, no hanyuma y’ukwo kuyoboka kwa Hezekiya, Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri araza, atera i Buyuda, asagaza inyuma y’ibisagara vyubakiwe inzitiro z’amabuye, agira ngw azovyihesha umuheto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Hezekiya abonye ko Senakeribu aje agabiye gutera i Yerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aja inama n’abaganwa biwe n’abashingantahe biwe, kugira ngo bazibire amariba ar’ inyuma y’igisagara; bemera gufatanya na we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.32.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 32:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko hakorana abantu benshi, bazibira amariba yose, n’ umugezi waca mur’ iyo ntāra; kuko bāvuga, bati Mbeg’ abami b’i Ashuri bokwama baza basanga amazi ari menshi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.5.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 5:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.25.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 25:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.22.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 22:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.22.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Hezekiya agumya umutima, asanura uruzitiro aho rwari rwarasenyutse hose, arwubakakw iminara, yubaka n’urundi ruzitiro inyuma yarwo, akomeza n’i Milo mu gisagara ca Dawidi; arondeza ibirwanishwa n’inkinzo vyinshi cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashirah’ abagabisha b’ingabo bamenyereye ivy’ intambara kuganza abantu, abakoraniriza hamwe ku nama kw irembo ry’ igisagara, ababarira amajambo yo kubaremēsha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 31:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 6:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.20.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ati Ni mushikame, mushire amanga, ntimutinye, ntimurandurwe imitima n’umwami w’i Ashuri bo na rirya sinzi ry’ ingabo riri kumwe na we; kuk’ Uwo turi kumwe ahambaye kuruta abari kumwe na we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.20.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 20:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.46.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 46:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.46.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.17.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 17:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ruhande rwiwe haherereye inkomezi z’ab’ umubiri, ariko mu ruhande rwacu haherereye Uhoraho Imana yacu, ngw adutabare, aturwanire mu ntambara zacu. Maz’ abantu baremēshwa n’ayo majambo ya Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma y’ivyo Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri, akir’ inyuma y’i Lakishi, bo n’ingabo ziwe zose, atuma intumwa i Yerusalemu kuri Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda, no ku Bayuda bose bar’ i Yerusalemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ziravuga, zit’ Uku ni ko Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri agize, ngo Mbega mwizigiye iki, gituma murorēra kw’i Yerusalemu harinda kwugarizwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngw Aho Hezekiya s’ukubahenda, kugira ngw abicishe inzara n’inyota? Kw ababarira ng’ Uhoraho Imana yacu izodukiza, ngo ntidukorokere mu maboko y’umwami w’i Ashuri! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo None Hezekiya uwo si we yakūyeh’ ibitabo vyayo n’ ibicaniro vyayo, akabarira Abayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu, ati Muze musengere imbere y’iki gicaniro conyene, abe ari ho mwosereza imibavu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo Mbega ntimuzi bo na ba sekuru uko bāgiriye amahanga yose yo mw isi? Ngo Non’ imana z’ayo mahanga yo mur’ ivyo bihugu zarashoboye na gatoya gukiza igihugu cazo ngo ntigikorokere mu maboko yiwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo None mu mana zose z’ amahanga ba sekuru baranduye rwose, n’iyihe yashoboye gukiza abantu bayo ngo ntibakorokere mu maboko yiwe, bitume n’ iyanyu na yo yoshobora kubamukiza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo None Hezekiya ntabahende, canke ngw abasuke mu buryo ben’ ubgo; ngo Ntimumwemerere; ngo Kukw ata mana n’imwe y’ihanga na rimwe canke y’igihugu ic’ ari co cose yashoboye gukiza abantu bayo ngo ntibakorokere mu maboko yiwe canke mu maboko ya ba sekuru; ngo Kugira ngw iyanyu na yo ishobore kubamukiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ izo ntumwa ziwe ziyongeranya gutuka Uhoraho Imana, na Hezekiya umusavyi wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Senakeribu yandika icete co kurogota k’Uhoraho Imana y’Abisirayeli no kumuvuga nabi, ngo Nk’ukw imana z’amahanga yo mu bihugu zitākijije abantu bazo, ngo ntibakorokere mu maboko yiwe, ngo Ni ko n’Imana ya Hezekiya itazokiza abantu bayo ngo ntibamukorokere mu maboko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mber’ izo ntumwa zivuga n’ ijwi rirenga mu rurimi rw’Ikiyuda, babibarira abantu b’i Yerusalemu bāri hejuru ku ruzitiro rw’amabuye, ngo babatere ubgoba, babarandure imitima, kugira ngo babone kunesha ico gisagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bavuga Imana y’i Yerusalemu nk’ah’ ari co kimwe n’imana z’ amahanga y’isi zakozwe n’intoke z’abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo bituma umwami Hezekiya, n’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya mwene Amosi, basenga, batakambira Iyo mw ijuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ Uhoraho arungika umumarayika, atikiza abahizi bose n’abakuru n’ abagabisha b’ingabo z’umwami w’i Ashuri, aho bari bashagaje. Nuk’ uwo mwami asubira mu gihugu ciwe amāramāye. Maz’ ashitse mu ngoro y’ikigirwamana ciwe, abo yivyariye bahamwicishiriza inkota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni k’Uhoraho yakijije Hezekiya n’ababa i Yerusalemu, abakūye mu maboko ya Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri, no mu maboko y’abandi bansi bose; nukw abaha impore impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.17.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 17:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze benshi bashikanira Uhoraho amashikanwa i Yerusalemu, kandi na Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda bamuzanira ibintu vy’igiciro kinini, bituma ashirwa hejuru imbere y’amahanga yose, uhereye ico gihe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
