          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Hezekiya yari n’itunga ryinshi n’icubahiro cinshi; yironderera ububīko bg’amafeza n’ ubg’ amazahabu n’ubg’ utubuyenge tw’igiciro kinini n’ubg’ imibavu n’ubg’ inkinzo n’ubg’ ibintu vyiza‐vyiza vy’uburyo bgose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yubaka n’amazu y’ibigega y’aho kwimburira ingano na vino n’amavuta ya elayo; n’ impongore z’ibitayega vyiwe vy’ uburyo bgose, n’impongore z’ imikuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yironkera n’ ibisagara, n’amasinzi y’imikuku n’amasho, kukw Imana yamuhaye ibintu vy’isinzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
